WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Crouching medium kick starts the low confirm.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The first Rush cancel reaches crouching heavy.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Standing and crouching medium punches continue the route.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The second Rush cancel exhausts the full starting Drive gauge.

5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.500
The second crouching heavy leads into both medium punches.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Go Ohsatsu continues the juggle without a Fuha stock.

7
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Normal-health Kaisen Dankairaku starts from the heavy special.

8
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.200
The Level 3 finishes the full-spend route.
